            <h1 class="refund_policy_heading">Vesopa EPOS Refund Policy</h1>
            <p>Vesopa EPOS is provided by <strong>Vesopa Software Ltd</strong>, registered in England and Wales, company number 17362206, Baglan Innovation Centre, Central Avenue, Baglan, Port Talbot SA12 7AX, United Kingdom. Email <a href="mailto:info@vesopa.com">info@vesopa.com</a>, telephone <a href="tel:+441792316282">+44 1792 316282</a>.</p>
            <p>At Vesopa EPOS, we are committed to providing high-quality EPOS solutions to meet your business needs. Please review our refund policy carefully before making a purchase.</p>
            
            <h2>1. 30-Day Refund Policy</h2>
            <p>We offer a 30-day refund policy for new customers. If you are not satisfied with our EPOS software or hardware within 30 days of purchase, you may request a refund, subject to the conditions outlined below.</p>
            
            <h2>2. Eligibility for Refund</h2>
