                <li><strong>Subscriptions:</strong> if you are not satisfied, contact us within 30 days of your first payment for a full refund of that payment. After that, you can cancel at any time and your service runs to the end of the term you have paid for; we do not refund part-used terms unless the law requires it.</li>
